<app-nav title="会员账户" /><view class="screen"><view class="heading">偏爱，有所积累。</view><text class="caption">余额与积分，都在这里</text><page-state loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" bindretry="retry" /><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}" class="enter"><view class="grid section"><data-card label="账户余额（元）" value="{{balance}}" note="下单时可选择余额抵扣" icon="wallet" dark /><data-card label="会员积分" value="{{points}}" note="积分权益以店铺规则为准" icon="leaf" /></view><view class="card section"><text class="subheading">余额说明</text><text class="member-copy">账户余额由店铺充值后发放，不支持自助充值。下单时可选择会员余额抵扣，余额不足时订单不会扣款。余额与积分以店铺记录为准，如有疑问请联系店铺核对。</text><button wx:if="{{supportPhone}}" class="secondary section" bindtap="call" hover-class="press">拨打店铺电话</button><button class="secondary section" open-type="contact" hover-class="press">咨询店铺</button></view></view></view>
